          "type": "heading",
          "text": "9. RWO Rolling Update Trap",
          "ink": "red"
        },
        {
          "type": "bullets",
          "items": [
            "`Multi-Attach error` = old node still holds the disk",
            "Deployment RollingUpdate + one RWO PVC = **stuck** new pod",
            "RWO means one __node__ — same-node pods still share it"
          ],
          "style": "cross",
          "frame": "dashed",
          "ink": "red"
        },
        {
          "type": "code",
          "lang": "yaml",
          "lines": [
            "strategy:",
            "  type: Recreate    # RWO safe",
            "# or StatefulSet +",
            "#   volumeClaimTemplates"
          ],
          "note": "old pod must detach first"
        },
